<</Title(The main objectives of this project are:)/Dest[21 0 R/XYZ 40 490 0]/Parent 2988 0 R/Prev 3005 0 R/Next 3007 0 R>>
endobj

3007 0 obj
<</Title(1. To understand the importance of plantation in public places.)/Dest[21 0 R/XYZ 40 466 0]/Parent 2988 0 R/Prev 3006 0 R/Next 3008 0 R>>
endobj

3008 0 obj
<</Title(2. To identify different types of trees, shrubs, and flowering plants suitable for public areas.)/Dest[21 0 R/XYZ 40 443 0]/Parent 2988 0 R/Prev 3007 0 R/Next 3009 0 R>>
endobj

3009 0 obj
<</Title(3. To create awareness about the environmental benefits of trees and plants.)/Dest[21 0 R/XYZ 40 419 0]/Parent 2988 0 R/Prev 3008 0 R/Next 3010 0 R>>
endobj

3010 0 obj
